  m_Name: Foreman Vargas
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.LieEncounterData
  vendorName: Foreman Vargas
  offerText: Pay my installation fee, and I will fit your room with a state-of-the-art
    thermal radiator. It will immediately cure your winter chills and brighten your
    miserable mood.
  acceptResultText: The radiator works perfectly, immediately warming your freezing
    bones. However, Vargas neglected to mention it is the size of a locomotive engine!
    It completely blocks your room, leaving you deeply annoyed.
  rejectResultText: You refuse his noisy machinery. You keep your money, but the
    bitter cold of your room leaves you shivering and miserable.
